<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 300 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 300 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered 300 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills on Tuesday,</p>
<p>the central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - March 25, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity of bills offered - June 24, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
